# Objects are never explicitly destroyed; when they become (preference)

Standing user preference: Objects are never explicitly destroyed; when they become unreachable, they may be reclaimed by the Evaporator (Garbage Collector).

## Conventions
- Objects are never explicitly destroyed; when they become unreachable, they may be reclaimed by the Evaporator (Garbage Collector).

